  "acceptanceCriteria": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Given the default range data, When the range validator runs, Then every (reference size, position, preflop action sequence) has a range and a plain-English justification, and a missing range or justification fails validation [REQ-035.1]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Given a 6-max opponent in the CO who open-raised preflop and has not yet acted on the flop, When postflop advice is computed with fewer than 30 observed hands of that opponent, Then equity is computed against exactly the authored default range for (6-max, CO, open-raise) [REQ-035.1]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Given an opponent whose range is {KhKd, 8h7h, AhKh, 9h9d, 6h5h, Th9h, QhJh, Ac2c} on flop Ks 8d 7c, When the opponent bets the flop, Then the narrowed range is the 6 combos {KhKd, 8h7h, AhKh, 9h9d, 6h5h, Th9h} (Air removed) [REQ-035.1, REQ-035.5]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Given the same range and flop, When the opponent checks the flop, Then the narrowed range is the 6 combos {AhKh, 9h9d, 6h5h, Th9h, QhJh, Ac2c} (Strong removed) [REQ-035.1, REQ-035.5]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Given the same range and flop, When the opponent calls a flop bet, Then the narrowed range is the 4 combos {AhKh, 9h9d, 6h5h, Th9h}; and When the opponent instead raises a flop bet, Then it is the 4 combos {KhKd, 8h7h, 6h5h, Th9h} [REQ-035.1, REQ-035.5]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Given the same range, When the opponent checks the flop Ks 8d 7c and then calls a bet on the turn 2d, Then the narrowed range is the 5 combos {AhKh, 9h9d, 6h5h, Th9h, Ac2c} (Ac2c now a Pair, QhJh still Air) [REQ-035.1, REQ-035.5]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Given two opponents with identical positions, actions and observed statistics but different bot styles, When their ranges are estimated, Then the ranges are identical [REQ-035.3]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Given code that passes a bot's style label or style parameters into the advice engine, When `npm run typecheck` runs, Then it reports a type error [REQ-035.3]",
      "checked": false
